      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The intensity of RNA and protein biosynthesis is studied in different tissues as well as in active and low-active fractions of liver chromatin, when adult and old rats are subjected to emotional-painful stress during 3 days. Significant stimulation of RNA and protein biosynthesis in chromatin fractions in liver and total RNA and protein in adrenals and hypothalamus is observed."},
